sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as 👩‍💻 Developer
    participant ARM as ☁️ Azure Resource Manager
    participant RVM as ⚙️ RVM Engine
    participant Store as 📁 Policy Store

    Note over Dev,Store: Policy authoring (one-time)
    Dev->>Store: Write Azure Policy (JSON)
    Store->>RVM: Compile to bytecode
    RVM-->>Store: 📦 Portable artifact stored

    Note over Dev,Store: Resource deployment (every request)
    Dev->>ARM: Create Storage Account
    ARM->>RVM: Evaluate against all policies
    
    Note over RVM: ⚡ Short-circuit evaluation:<br/>Check type first → skip 90%<br/>Zero heap allocations<br/>Cached rule results
    
    RVM-->>ARM: ✅ Allow / ❌ Deny
    ARM-->>Dev: Deployment result

    Note over Dev,Store: Same engine, different language
    Dev->>Store: Write Cedar policy
    Store->>RVM: Compile to SAME bytecode
    RVM-->>Store: 📦 Same format, same engine
